407	/// In an old-layout response (no `ToolReturned` event directly after the
408	/// `HandoffOccurred`), each `ToolCalled` event of the scanned run is a
409	/// transfer call. In a new-layout response (a non-empty run of `ToolReturned`
410	/// events directly after the `HandoffOccurred`), the transfer calls are only
411	/// the calls of the scanned run that a result of that run closes: each result
412	/// closes the earliest call of the scanned run with its id that no earlier
413	/// result of the run closed. Another `ToolCalled` event of the scanned run
414	/// (for example an open call of a `ParallelAgent` sibling) is not a transfer
